{
  "slug": "tally-erp",
  "name": "Tally Erp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Claude Code plugin that gives Claude read-only access to a running TallyPrime instance via its XML/HTTP\ngateway. Ships a cross-platform tally CLI plus ~33 ready-made request templates so Claude can query ledgers,\nvouchers, stock items, and standard reports (Day Book, Trial Balance, P&L, Balance Sheet, etc.) with typed\nflags — no hand-crafted XML required.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `tally-erp` (Read-only access to a running TallyPrime instance over its built-in XML/HTTP gateway).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install tally-erp@claude-community` from `piyushgarg-dev/tally-erp-skill`.\n\nAuthor: Piyush Garg — Software Engineer | Tech Content Creator & YouTuber",
